---
source: src/core/video/playback.rs
expression: out
---
Stopped + Play -> Playing
Stopped + Pause -> Stopped
Stopped + TogglePlayPause -> Playing
Stopped + Stop -> Stopped
Stopped + Seek -> Stopped
Stopped + ReachedEnd -> Stopped
Stopped + Loaded { autoplay: true } -> Playing
Playing + Play -> Playing
Playing + Pause -> Paused
Playing + TogglePlayPause -> Paused
Playing + Stop -> Stopped
Playing + Seek -> Playing
Playing + ReachedEnd -> Ended
Playing + Loaded { autoplay: true } -> Playing
Paused + Play -> Playing
Paused + Pause -> Paused
Paused + TogglePlayPause -> Playing
Paused + Stop -> Stopped
Paused + Seek -> Paused
Paused + ReachedEnd -> Paused
Paused + Loaded { autoplay: true } -> Playing
Ended + Play -> Playing (pos=0)
Ended + Pause -> Ended
Ended + TogglePlayPause -> Playing (pos=0)
Ended + Stop -> Stopped
Ended + Seek -> Paused
Ended + ReachedEnd -> Ended
Ended + Loaded { autoplay: true } -> Playing
